\newlabel{fig:foursets}{{2}{3}{The hypothesis \eqref {eq:pingpong} for the letter $a$ (left) and the letter $b$ (right). The letter $a$ maps each of $D_a$, $D_b$ and $D_{b^{-1}}$ to one of the small dark discs inside $D_a$; nothing is required of $a$ on $D_{a^{-1}}$. The pictures for $a^{-1}$ and $b^{-1}$ are the mirror images}{figure.2}{}}
